TrueSchool Ascii / rewtnull amigafonts — TopazPlus_a500.ttf only.

Upstream: https://github.com/rewtnull/amigafonts
(also http://www.trueschool.se)

Only TopazPlus_a500.ttf is vendored here, as a faithful Amiga-aspect
remake of the Kickstart 1.x Topaz system font, for @font-face embedding
in the retr-oq Amiga Workbench theme. No other faces from the pack
(Topaz, P0T-NOoDLE, MicroKnight, mO'sOul, …) are included.

These fonts are released under the GPL with the Font Exception (GPL-FE):

  http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-faq.html#FontException

The GNU GPL Font Exception, quoted:

  As a special exception, if you create a document which uses this
  font, and embed this font or unaltered portions of this font into
  the document, this font does not by itself cause the resulting
  document to be covered by the GNU General Public License. This
  exception does not however invalidate any other reasons why the
  document might be covered by the GNU General Public License. If you
  modify this font, you may extend this exception to your version of
  the font, but you are not obligated to do so. If you do not wish to
  do so, delete this exception statement from your version.

The full GNU GPL v2 text is at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html

